id: team-pose
name: Team Pose
talentCategory: skill
prerequisites: Show Stopping Performance
description: >
  With the others in your group, your group performance grows stronger as everyone performs together.
text: >
  Team Pose: With the others in your group, your group performance grows stronger as everyone performs together.
  –Prerequisites: Show Stopping Performance
  (1)-[Triggered]: If an Ally uses the Hype Maneuver within a Sphere AoE centered on you, regain 2(bT) Ki Points.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use the Hype Maneuver, any Allies within a Sphere AoE centered on you that have the Show Stopping Performance Talent may use the Hype Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# (1) An Ally's Hype Maneuver used (chat.mjs allyHyped, the `ally-hype` Moment): Automatic by default - within the Sphere taken
# as so - or, set Triggered, asked each time.
[triggered/ally-hype, effect 1]
ki.value += 2(bT);

# (2) Your Hype's card: the Hype offered out of sequence to each of your Allies with Show Stopping Performance - who is within
# the Sphere, the table's - once an Encounter, spent as the first is taken; the others that card offered stay (chat.mjs
# teamPoseOffers).
[passive]
allow teamPose.allyHype;
